WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:11,060
Map teaching materials, documentary animations can all be saved offline

2
00:00:11,060 --> 00:00:15,060
Mo Shiyi had a power outage and couldn't find anything on the Internet.

3
00:00:15,060 --> 00:00:19,060
Momo is still so young and she can’t rely entirely on me to teach her how to read and write in the future.

4
00:00:19,060 --> 00:00:25,770
Download the information slowly and cook first

5
00:00:25,770 --> 00:00:29,920
Momo is now two years old and it is the time for her body to grow.

6
00:00:29,920 --> 00:00:31,920
Canned Guangtun instant noodles are not acceptable.

7
00:00:31,920 --> 00:00:33,920
Children's meals must be prepared separately

8
00:00:33,920 --> 00:00:34,920
Mom meat

9
00:00:34,920 --> 00:00:38,070
You feel hungry when you see your mother cooking, right?

10
00:00:38,070 --> 00:00:43,570
I can only eat one and I need to eat normally after a while

11
00:00:43,570 --> 00:00:47,660
Didn’t you just say one and two?

12
00:00:47,660 --> 00:00:49,660
Little liars should do more of this.

13
00:00:49,660 --> 00:00:51,660
It will be inconvenient to eat out in the future

14
00:00:51,660 --> 00:00:53,660
One bite at a time, it’s not easy for people to notice

15
00:00:53,660 --> 00:00:55,980
Momo has a day off tomorrow

16
00:00:55,980 --> 00:00:57,980
Then move today
